  "title": "Keep campaign accounts, data and reporting organised | Fyntix",
  "description": "Keep marketing accounts, approved information and reporting organised so the business can understand and maintain the programme as people change.",
  "classes": "page-shell w-full relative min-h-screen pointer-events-auto",
